{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "comet-hunter-s-treasure",
  "name": "Comet Hunter's Treasure",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Comet_Hunter%27s_Treasure",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-07-25T08:56:07.867Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "comet-hunter-s-treasure-i",
      "label": "Comet Hunter's Treasure (I)",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To Treasure Hunters: (I)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-07e74cfc3dd86f1b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Ha! You are fooled!"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "There is no \"treasure\" at all."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The only reward is the four scrawls by me hidden in this room. You must have recognized it. Yes, there's lord Herta's handwriting as well. Surprise, eh?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If you are a junior who worries all day to impress your boss, take a deep breath! No good if you have a heart attack now."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If you are one of those playful young fellows, I'd suggest you take them, go back to them when you find life miserable and have a good laugh when you are not busy doing your research in a dark corner of the tower."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-31b82059856e266e"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Laughing Hosea Lazaro"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7e93cd3ec4478480"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "volumeKey": "comet-hunter-s-treasure-ii",
      "label": "Comet Hunter's Treasure (II)",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To Treasure Hunters: (II)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-4912e3d53c5f5e60"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Right, if you are reading this, you've probably listened to me. That means you always follow through with what you started."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I have to admit, it would hurt my reputation had I asked you to go through so much trouble just for nothing."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "After all, I can't foresee to whom this letter will go so many Amber Eras later."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "There is a chance, however unlikely it may be, that you are a future defender of my reputation, someone worthy of my legacy."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Wouldn't want to accidentally put you under friendly fire, would I?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Hm, so be it. It's time that I bring forward the real treasure."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f9e364781b963ebb"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Your Respected Hosea Lazaro"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-87e55b1244be026c"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3",
      "volumeKey": "comet-hunter-s-treasure-iii",
      "label": "Comet Hunter's Treasure (III)",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To Treasure Hunters: (III)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f3a8c9ab85f9e2db"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Have you tried a type of soda named \"Kapo-Kali\"?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It was once the signature of the space station, extremely popular in the Southern Orion system."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sorry to brag, but I'm indeed the creator of the famous Astro Rod and Cosmos Guide."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "And undoubtedly, \"Kapo-Kali\" is also my creation."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The IPC offered me five million credits for the recipe and I turned them down."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Wen Huairen from the Herta Department of Implement Arts attempted (and failed) to steal it 33 times, all resulting in him getting a good smack from me."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I will now make the recipe public..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Five million's worth! See you in the next letter."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-40c5c8d7a895fadd"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Legendary Drink-Maker Hosea Lazaro"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c29feba3ba053ada"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "volumeKey": "comet-hunter-s-treasure-iv",
      "label": "Comet Hunter's Treasure (IV)",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To Treasure Hunters: (IV)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-92e35f81bbfa2980"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "████████████████████████████████"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "████████████████████████████████"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "████████████████████████████████"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-fc08495369edae06"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Yes, you are seeing it right. Above is the secret recipe of Kapo-Kali."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I swear on my Mom's life that it's authentic."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If you are one of us, you'll know how to decrypt it."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Got a tip for you: A specific method of autoradiography is required to reveal the text."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3e3772976ca0521c"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Hosea Lazaro the Terrific"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-2d2762ee801e38ec"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
